	<section_number>38.2-1107</section_number>
	<catch_line>Membership in rating organizations</catch_line>
	<text>
		No captive insurer shall be required to join a rating organization.
	</text>
	<history>1980, c. 665, § 38.1-926; 1986, c. 562.</history>
